Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Local Music on the phone: artist, then album, then song

Local Music now opens on its Artists tab. An artist grouped out of a device
folder opens as a folder page of its own, on its Albums (then a Songs tab),
so the device's music reads artist -> album -> song. Album tracks follow
their track tags and, without them, their file names read numerically, the
order the folder lists them in; Android Auto's albums use the same order.

